   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the correction law, in relation to making technical corrections thereto",
    "basePrintNo": "S7642",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S7642-2013",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Amd §500, Cor L",
    "lawSection": "Correction Law",
    "memo": "BILL NUMBER:S7642\n\nTITLE  OF  BILL:    An act to amend the correction law, in relation to\nmaking technical corrections thereto\n\nPURPOSE:\n\nThis bill fixes an incorrect reference to a subdivision in section 500\nof the correction law.\n\nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection one fixes a technical error in section 500 of  the  correction\nlaw,  which  governs  local  correctional  facilities, by changing the\nreference to the definition of  a  local  correctional  facility  from\nsubdivision  fifteen  to  subdivision  sixteen  of  section  2  of the\ncorrection law.\n\nSection two states that this act shall take effect immediately.\n\nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nSection 500 of the correction law  incorrectly  references  the  wrong\nsubdivision  of  section  2  of  the  correction law in regards to the\ndefinition of a \"local correctional facility.\"  Subdivision sixteen of\nsection 2 of the correction law provides this  definition.  This  bill\nmakes  a  technical  change  to  section  500 of the correction law to\nreference the correct subdivision.\n\nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNew bill.\n\nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone.\n\nEFFECTIVE DATE:\n\nImmediately.\n\n",
